#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:543
msgid "The saved station configuration is malformed. Your data was not changed; fix the servers entry or use Settings → Import."
msgstr "La configuración de emisoras guardada está dañada. Tus datos no se han modificado; corrige la entrada servers o usa Ajustes → Importar."

#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:960
